 "text": "Assessor / Fountain County, Indiana\nBreaking News\nAPC Meeting October 22nd 8:00 pm: Solar Ordinance public hearing\nSkip over navigation\nFountain County, Indiana\nMenu\nHome\nGovernment  Elected Officials  Commissioners  Meeting Center\nCounty Council  Meeting Center\nAssessor\nAuditor\nClerk\nCoroner\nFountain Circuit Court\nProsecutor\nRecorder\nTreasurer\nDepartments  Ambulance\nCommunity Corrections\nHealth\nHighway\nPlanning & Zoning  Plan Commission\nProbation\nPurdue Extension\nVeterans Affairs\nPublic Safety  911 Communications (Fountain/Warren Counties)\nEmergency Management  ADA Plan\nSheriff\nElection  Absentee Voting\nCandidate Information\nElection Information\nPoll Workers\nVoter Registration\nVoting Locations\nCommunity  Browse the County Staff\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nRegister for the County Emergency Notification System\nTour the County Courthouse Murals\nView FAQs\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Forms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nOrdinances & Resolutions\nPlans & Maps\nSearch\nSubmit\nStart Content\nContact Us\nCounty Courthouse\n301 4th St\nCovington, IN 47932 Get Directions\nPhone: (765) 793-6206\nStaff Directory\nHours: Monday - Friday\n8:00 am - 4:00 pm\nTopics of Interest\nCyclical Reassessment of Land & Improvements\nAppeals\nCommercial & Industrial\nRental Properties\nMobile Homes\nPersonal Property\nNew Construction\nAddress Request\nProperty Tax Assessment Board of Appeals (PTABOA)\nProperty Tax Exemptions- Nonprofits\nProperty Tax Deductions\nDLGF Tax Bill Estimator\nProperty Record Card Search on Engage\nFind Your Legislator\nAbout Us\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make a Selection Cyclical Reassessment of Land & Improvements Appeals Commercial & Industrial Rental Properties Mobile Homes Personal Property New Construction Address Request Property Tax Assessment Board of Appeals (PTABOA) Property Tax Exemptions- Nonprofits Property Tax Deductions DLGF Tax Bill Estimator Property Record Card Search on Engage Find Your Legislator About Us Topic Home\nMore Information\nFind content and services related to this page.\nDocument Center News & Notices\nUseful Links\nJump to a content archive Make a Selection Document Center\n- News & Notices\n- Useful Links\nHome\nGovernment\nAssessor\nAssessor\nOverview\nThe Office of the Fountain County Assessor is responsible for accurately and uniformly determining the market value in the use of every property in the county. This is achieved by using three approaches to value: Cost, Income, and Sales Comparison. The State now requires annual adjustments of assessments to reflect changes in the market. Below you will find documents explaining various processes used in the valuation of the property. We encourage you to contact us with any questions or concerns regarding your assessment.\nAssessment Increases 2026 power-point\nProperty Information Searches\nVisit the Engage Website to view Property Cards, Mapping, and Taxes, and access other important forms!\nView a sample property record card (PDF) explaining the information that is displayed on the card.\nRead an explanation of the parcel numbering system (PDF)\nSocial Media\nFollow Fountain County Assessors Office on Facebook!\nImportant Links for Taxpayers\nView a list of township trustees\nNeighborhood Trending Example (PDF)\nAnnual Adjustments (Trending) Fact Sheet (PDF)\nIndiana Code Regarding Annual Adjustments (Trending) (PDF)\nProperty Tax Caps/Circuit Breaker Credits Fact Sheet (PDF)\nProperty Class Codes (PDF)\nHeritage Barn Deduction Form (PDF)\nThe Indiana Department of Local Government Finance\n2025 Legislation Affecting Assessment Matters\n2021 Real Property Assessment Guidelines and Manual\nDLGF Citizen's Guide to Property Tax\nDLGF Forms\nNEWS\nLINKS\nNews\nAssessment Increases 2026\nCyclical Reassessment Map 2026-2029\nParcel Numbering System\nUseful Links\nSample Property Record Card\nFOUNTAIN COUNTY, IN\n301 4th St., Covington, IN 47932 • M-F 8:00am - 4:00pm • 765-793-5000 • Staff Directory\n© 2026 Fountain County, Indiana\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use\n-->\nSite Design and Content Management by\nCORE Business Technologies",
